WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.467 --> 00:00:09.247
I felt sorry for Bada.

2
00:00:09.248 --> 00:00:13.520
Why? Because I made him do all the work.

3
00:00:13.521 --> 00:00:18.358
Remember the three wishes?

4
00:00:18.359 --> 00:00:20.555
Hana: I will hide a treasure.

5
00:00:20.556 --> 00:00:22.368
Close your eyes.

6
00:00:22.369 --> 00:00:25.765
Bada: Okay. I closed my eyes.

7
00:00:25.766 --> 00:00:31.044
Hana: Hey, don't peek!

8
00:00:31.045 --> 00:00:36.377
Bada: I'm not! Tell me when to open my eyes!

9
00:00:36.378 --> 00:00:39.015
Hana: Now, you can open your eyes.

10
00:00:39.016 --> 00:00:41.939
Hana: There is a hidden treasure in the house.

11
00:00:41.940 --> 00:00:45.517
Where could it be?

12
00:00:45.518 --> 00:00:48.079
Bada: Give me the first clue.

13
00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:51.279
Hana: Look on the place where you sleep.

14
00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:53.501
Bada: Where I sleep?

15
00:00:53.502 --> 00:01:00.761
Aha! Here it is!

16
00:01:00.762 --> 00:01:03.555
Bada: Mom, what does it say?

17
00:01:03.556 --> 00:01:09.076
Mom: It says, "Go brush your teeth."

18
00:01:09.077 --> 00:01:13.570
Bada: Of course, the bathroom!

19
00:01:13.571 --> 00:01:16.294
Brush my teeth.

20
00:01:16.295 --> 00:01:21.138
Here it is!

21
00:01:21.139 --> 00:01:25.186
Bada ran around the house looking for the treasure.

22
00:01:25.187 --> 00:01:27.945
And at last, he found it.

23
00:01:27.946 --> 00:01:32.908
Boy, was he happy!
